Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:09:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(otsuka): re-order the ladder's final candidates by a
 helper probe

QUIP_OTSUKA_BP_PROBE_HELPER=<command>: a second helper process (the same solver with a
short probe configuration) probes the best QUIP_OTSUKA_BP_PROBE_N final candidates; each
probe's best read is verified on our graph and the candidates are re-ordered by probe
energy before the top-K full solves. Probe results are never pushed. Probe helper down
= ladder order. QUIP_OTSUKA_BP_PROBE_TIMEOUT_S bounds one probe.
